/// Checks for slicing expressions which are equivalent to dereferencing the
/// value.
///
/// ### Why restrict this?
/// Some people may prefer to dereference rather than slice.
///
/// ### Example
/// ```no_run
/// let vec = vec![1, 2, 3];
/// let slice = &vec[..];
/// ```
/// Use instead:
